<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested on Wednesday, USDA said.</p>
<p>There were reported sales on 100 head, bringing the week to date total to 14,700 head.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select and Choice 2-4 1150 lbs  2 lds $74.00.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
